CPU limit set for App1
Memory limit set for App1
App1 assigned to cgroup

Cgroup created for App2
CPU limit set for App2
Memory limit set for App2
App2 assigned to cgroup

Cgroup created for App3
CPU limit set for App3
Memory limit set for App3
App3 assigned to cgroup

Result:
    *Thus, the algorithm uses cgroups to control CPU and memory usage of applications, helping to achieve balanced resource utilization and efficient system performance.

